WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.768 --> 00:00:15.711
The Carters were babysitting Martha again.

2
00:00:15.712 --> 00:00:18.494
Rover wanted to help.

3
00:00:18.495 --> 00:00:21.640
"You can't help," Emmy said.

4
00:00:21.641 --> 00:00:25.213
"Dogs don't babysit."

5
00:00:25.214 --> 00:00:29.014
Rover looked very sad.

6
00:00:29.015 --> 00:00:32.814
Baby Martha was playing on the floor.

7
00:00:32.815 --> 00:00:37.264
Rover tried to sit next to her.

8
00:00:37.265 --> 00:00:41.245
"Not there!" Harry said.

9
00:00:41.246 --> 00:00:44.863
Rover moved across the room.

10
00:00:44.864 --> 00:00:49.759
He sat on the rug and watched Martha.

11
00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:52.638
She dropped her teddy bear.

12
00:00:52.639 --> 00:00:57.554
Rover rushed to pick it up.

13
00:00:57.555 --> 00:01:01.306
"Stop, Rover!" Emmy said.

14
00:01:01.307 --> 00:01:05.409
She grabbed Martha's teddy bear.

15
00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:09.723
"Rover needs some rules," Mom said.

16
00:01:09.724 --> 00:01:14.025
"Don't chew Martha's toys," Emmy said.

17
00:01:14.026 --> 00:01:17.662
"You will make her cry."

18
00:01:17.663 --> 00:01:22.391
"Don't bark at Baby Martha," Oliver said.

19
00:01:22.392 --> 00:01:26.414
"You will scare her."

20
00:01:26.415 --> 00:01:30.671
"Don't jump on the baby," Harry said.

21
00:01:30.672 --> 00:01:33.412
"You will hurt her."

22
00:01:33.413 --> 00:01:38.920
Rover did not chew or bark or jump.

23
00:01:38.921 --> 00:01:44.057
He sat on the rug and looked sad.

24
00:01:44.058 --> 00:01:49.521
Later Harry found one of Martha's books.

25
00:01:49.522 --> 00:01:53.543
There were many teeth marks on the cover!

26
00:01:53.544 --> 00:01:55.509
"Rover chewed this book.

27
00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:58.862
Bad dog!" Harry said.

28
00:01:58.863 --> 00:02:04.179
Rover looked very sad.

29
00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:07.718
"Wait a minute," Emmy said.

30
00:02:07.719 --> 00:02:11.770
"Look at Baby Martha!"

31
00:02:11.771 --> 00:02:17.401
The baby was chewing on another book.

32
00:02:17.402 --> 00:02:19.449
"Rover doesn't chew books.

33
00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:26.556
Martha does!" Emmy said.

34
00:02:26.557 --> 00:02:30.134
Rover barked loudly.

35
00:02:30.135 --> 00:02:33.610
He jumped on Emmy and gave her a big kiss.

36
00:02:33.611 --> 00:02:41.366
Emmy laughed. "Good dog, Rover!"
